WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.423
When you apply, drag the card.

2
00:00:02.423 --> 00:00:05.460
Every move lands on a timeline,
and one click undoes it.

3
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.030
Cards turn red when an
application goes quiet.

4
00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:14.345
Favorites are separate: star anything,
even a closed posting, and add a note.
